    note "USAGE EXAMPLE:<br/>```python<br/>from proximadb import UnifiedClient, proto<br/><br/># Auto-detect best protocol<br/>client = UnifiedClient('https://api.proximadb.com')<br/><br/># Create collection with quantization<br/>config = proto.CollectionConfig(<br/>    name='embeddings',<br/>    dimension=768,<br/>    distance_metric=proto.DistanceMetric.COSINE,<br/>    storage_engine=proto.StorageEngine.VIPER,<br/>    quantization_config=proto.QuantizationConfig(<br/>        level=proto.QuantizationLevel.PQ8<br/>    )<br/>)<br/>collection = client.create_collection(config)<br/><br/># Insert vectors with metadata<br/>vectors = [<br/>    proto.VectorRecord(<br/>        vector=[0.1, 0.2, ...],<br/>        metadata=[<br/>            proto.MetadataItem(key='category', value='tech'),<br/>            proto.MetadataItem(key='year', value='2025')<br/>        ]<br/>    )<br/>]<br/>client.insert_vectors(collection.id, vectors)<br/><br/># Search with optimization hints<br/>query = proto.SearchQuery(<br/>    query_vector=[0.1, 0.2, ...],<br/>    k=10,<br/>    metadata_filters={'category': 'tech'},<br/>    optimization_hints=proto.SearchOptimizationHints(<br/>        two_stage_search=True,<br/>        candidate_multiplier=3.0<br/>    )<br/>)<br/>results = client.search_vectors(collection.id, query)<br/>```"